Package: pkgclean
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, fzf, sudo
Suggests: flatpak
Maintainer: Ars <draganarseniy039@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bywrd/pkgclean
Description: Interactive terminal uninstaller and system cleaner
 Pick an app from a list (no need to remember package names) and remove it
 with or without its leftovers. Also cleans orphaned dependencies and caches.
 Supports pacman, apt and dnf.
